<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;"><strong>Share Your Feedback at the Kilbourne Run Sports Park Open House </strong></h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">You are invited to attend the open house for Kilbourne Run Sports Park! Stop by the open house on Wednesday, Oct. 4, anytime from 6-7:30 p.m. at Woodward Park Community Center, located at 5147 Karl Road, Columbus. You can see a proposed concept for the site, and share your feedback and suggestions. </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Kilbourne Run Sports Park is one of Columbus’ busiest soccer locations, welcoming more than 38,000 youth and adult participants annually. Kilbourne Run Sports Park is part of the Community Sports Park project, which makes significant investments in sports facilities across the City. The additional park and facilities investments that make up the project will provide residents like you with access to a variety of recreational opportunities.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Your feedback will help shape the future of this great community space! <a href="https://columbusrecparks.com/connect/about/capital-improvement-projects/kilbourne-run-sports-park/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">Learn more about Kilbourne Run Sports Park project</a>.</p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2023/10/8304402/5003736/9-20-2023-kilbourne-run-rendering_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="Kilbourne Run Sports Park" width="570" height="369">
