<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">The Columbus Community Sports Park will be located on the grounds of Historic Crew Stadium and adjacent to the Ohio State Fairgrounds along Interstate 71, between East 17th Avenue and Hudson Street.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">The Community Sports Park has two primary components. The first is facilities for organized – formal – sports programs. These will be available for rent by families, local teams, traveling leagues and others. These could include multi-use wood courts, tournament-level synthetic turf fields, indoor field space, meeting rooms, classrooms, a rock climbing wall, a concessions area or covered outdoor Pickleball courts.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">The second is informal sports and community park spaces, which will be available at no cost to residents and teams.  These could include mixed-use grass fields,  basketball courts, walking and bicycling trails with exercise stations, green space with an outdoor courtyard or plaza, open shelters, picnic tables, a playground, a splash pad or a skate park.</p>
<h2 style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #CB343C; font-size: 18px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Share your Ideas!</h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">The City is asking for feedback on the activities and facilities that residents would like to have at the new Columbus Community Sports Park. Take the survey and give your input today: <a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/bit.ly/ccspsurvey21?%21%21J-4R7rTSYA%21Ns_UDNuH_E0naEudIFkafDM8BakEpr-3Lwpp9C-0c69GIM6x0uP_OxhPhqv0NTs3rcUF%24=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">http://bit.ly/ccspsurvey21</a>.</p>
<p class="has-text-color" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Learn more and sign up for project updates at <a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/crpdsports.org/communitysportspark?%21%21J-4R7rTSYA%21Ns_UDNuH_E0naEudIFkafDM8BakEpr-3Lwpp9C-0c69GIM6x0uP_OxhPhqv0Nf9k-sVI%24=&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CRPDSports.org/CommunitySportsPark</a>.</p>
